===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{intransitive}} To fall apart into shards, usually as the result of impact or explosion.
# {{transitive}} To break (something) into shards.
# {{context|online role-playing|transitive}} To divide (an [[MMORPG]]) into several [[#Noun|shards]], or to establish a shard of one.
# ((transitive)) The act of flatulence unintentionally accompanied by a typically small amount of feces. Example: Mario was so excited as the result of a game-winning home run, that he sharded in his pants.

